BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lovettsville Oktoberfest (30th)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T170000
DTSTAMP:20260919T145512Z
UID:lovettsville-oktoberfest-30th-2026-09-26@fairs-festivals
CATEGORIES:german,oktoberfest,festival,family
DESCRIPTION:The Town of Lovettsville's 30th Oktoberfest\, back around the 
 Squirkle and Town Hall. German food and beer\, stein hauling and hoisting
 \, the Wiener Dog Races\, Kinderfest for kids\, and 50+ artisans and local
  businesses. Free shuttles run 9:30am to 6pm from Lovettsville Community P
 ark.\n\nMore info: https://www.lovettsvilleoktoberfest.com/
LOCATION:Zoldos Square & Town Hall\, 6 E Pennsylvania Ave\, Lovettsville\,
  VA 20180
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.lovettsvilleoktoberfest.com/
END:VEVENT
